  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transparency and Accountability Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective (PDO) is to contribute (i) to enhance transparency and efficiency in public financial managementcomma and (ii) to strengthen accountability in the use of public resource. The project will play a key role in Cameroon in accelerating the pace toward a more orderly and open PFM and thus more efficient service delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
